---
const footerLinks = [
  { label: "Hack Club", href: "https://hackclub.com/" },
  { label: "Slack", href: "https://hackclub.com/slack/" },
  { label: "Clubs", href: "https://hackclub.com/clubs/" },
  { label: "Hackathons", href: "https://hackathons.hackclub.com/" },
];
---

<footer id="footer" class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-haven-green">
  <div class="relative h-[clamp(22rem,30vw,30rem)] w-full">
    <img
      src="/images/haven-footer-bg.png"
      alt=""
      class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-auto w-full min-w-[72rem] max-w-none"
    />

    <img
      src="/images/haven-logo-footer.png"
      alt="Hack Club Haven"
      class="absolute left-[10.14%] top-[10%] w-[24.93%] min-w-[12rem] max-w-[18rem]"
    />

    <nav
      aria-label="Footer"
      class="absolute left-[13.2%] top-[45%] flex flex-col font-darumadrop text-[clamp(1.7rem,2.7vw,2.5rem)] leading-[1.16] tracking-normal text-white"
    >
      {
        footerLinks.map((link) => (
          <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="w-fit transition-transform hover:scale-105">
            {link.label}
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </nav>

    <div
      class="absolute left-[45.2%] top-[28%] w-[44.65%] whitespace-pre-wrap font-jua text-[clamp(0.85rem,1.4vw,1.25rem)] leading-none tracking-normal text-white"
    >
      <p>
        Hack Club is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit and network of 100k+ technical high schoolers. We believe you learn best
        by building, so we&rsquo;re creating community and providing grants so you can make awesome projects. In the
        past few years, we&rsquo;ve <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ufMUJ9D1fi8"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-white decoration-solid underline-offset-2"
          >sent 30 teen hackers hiking the Pacific Crest Trail</a
        >, <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8iM1W8kXrQA"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-white decoration-solid underline-offset-2"
          >hosted a hackathon for the worst ideas</a
        >, and <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kaEFv7e49mo"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-white decoration-solid underline-offset-2"
          >ran the largest teen hardware hackathon at GitHub HQ</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-[1em]">
        Read about Hack Club in <a
          href="https://www.wsj.com/articles/teen-hackers-try-to-convince-parents-they-are-up-to-good-11569922200"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-white decoration-solid underline-offset-2"
          >The Wall Street Journal</a
        >, <a
          href="https://www.cbsnews.com/sanfrancisco/news/hack-club-hosts-teen-coders-san-francisco/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-white decoration-solid underline-offset-2"
          >CBS News</a
        >, and <a
          href="https://www.nasa.gov/learning-resources/space-out-this-summer-with-variety-of-nasa-stem-activities/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-white decoration-solid underline-offset-2"
          >NASA.gov</a
        >, or watch us <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/live/UbfAhFxDomE?si=5DiK1_hGqKrB_r50&t=7033"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-white decoration-solid underline-offset-2"
          >on stage with AMD CEO Lisa Su at CES</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-[1em]">Hack Club Haven is being ran by Barnav, Kaylee, Katie, and Jolly</p>

      <p class="mt-[1em]">Made with ♥ by teenagers, for teenagers at Hack Club</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
